# Hydro-Man, Fluid Felon. T1: Bot1 casts him with Island and Mox Sapphire. At his end step he untaps and becomes a land with
# "{T}: Add U" until Bot1's next turn: he taps for U the turn he entered (a land has no summoning sickness) and a Consider cast with
# that mana does not pump him, because the "if Hydro-Man is a creature" is false (CR 603.4); he is exactly a land (the creature types and
# power gone, CR 205.1a). T3: he is a creature again as the turn begins. Consider (blue) pumps him +1/+1 each
# time; Mox Ruby (colorless) and Lightning Bolt (red) do not, and neither does Bot2's own blue Consider, cast on Bot1's turn.

